      "definition": "CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.current_tenant_id()\n RETURNS uuid\n LANGUAGE sql\n STABLE SECURITY DEFINER\n SET search_path TO 'pg_catalog'\nAS $function$\n  select tenant_id from public.profiles where id = auth.uid()\n$function$\n",
